      "y": 895,
      "width": 2500,
      "height": 60,
      "text": "1. NEW Review Dashboard (screen 3) - shows all extracted stories/points, user picks which to review\n2. Story Review is now CHAT-BASED with 0-10 rating (screen 4) - AI asks clarifying questions until user reaches desired accuracy\n3. Point Review is now CHAT-BASED with 0-10 rating (screen 5) - AI refines formulation until user fully agrees\n4. Users can ACCEPT at any rating (not forced to 10/10) or REJECT entirely\n5. Publish screen (6) shows final summary with ratings and allows publishing approved items",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "strokeColor": "#374151",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
